{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TH","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"帖撒罗尼迦前书","commonName":"帖撒罗尼迦前书","title":"帖撒罗尼迦前书","order":52,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"7b779bb57cdb15502b32872ce7115f34d550b7e02fcb8944aaa603955206b944","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TH/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":89},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["问候"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["保罗、西拉、提摩太写信给帖撒罗尼迦在父 神和主耶稣基督里的教会。愿恩惠、平安归与你们！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["帖撒罗尼迦信徒的信心和榜样"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我们为你们众人常常感谢 神，祷告的时候提到你们，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["在 神—我们的父面前，不住地记念你们因信心所做的工夫，因爱心所受的劳苦，因盼望我们主耶稣基督所存的忍耐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["被 神所爱的弟兄啊，我知道你们是蒙拣选的；"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因为我们的福音传到你们那里，不独在乎言语，也在乎权能和圣灵，并充足的信心。正如你们知道，我们在你们那里，为你们的缘故是怎样为人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["并且你们在大难之中，蒙了圣灵所赐的喜乐，领受真道就效法我们，也效法了主；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["甚至你们作了马其顿和亚该亚所有信主之人的榜样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["因为主的道从你们那里已经传扬出来。你们向 神的信心不但在马其顿和亚该亚，就是在各处也都传开了，所以不用我们说什么话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["因为他们自己已经报明我们是怎样进到你们那里，你们是怎样离弃偶像，归向 神，要服事那又真又活的 神，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["等候他儿子从天降临，就是他从死里复活的—那位救我们脱离将来忿怒的耶稣。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TH/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TH/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/COL/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}